{"id":"vod_hh_71911","vodId":"71911","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"叮当猫","name_cn":"叮当猫","date":"1993-01-01","year":"1993","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第160集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/f381b8e26545093aa5f7b84545f0b400.jpg"},"summary":"很多人一定还记得这首歌“美琪和她妈妈到山上去，发生一件事情很稀奇，她们遇到一只黄色的小野猫，跟着他们不离去……”随着这部动画的热播，这首主题曲也广为流传。歌词的内容即可概括故事的剧情。小学一年级的木叶美琪和爸爸妈妈到山上去玩，在树林里，意外发现了一只橘色长尾巴的狸猫。小狸猫长得很可爱，又无家可归，于是美琪一家把狸猫带回了家，把她命名为“叮当猫”。叮当猫会施展各种法术，惹出了不少有趣的故事，带给大家很多欢乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-17 14:48:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":160,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4n3Q7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXBlLvb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyWyo6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penWkR5a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMnAZmb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw6w0rb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0j7Y5b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOpDMRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDKoq6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGNrvKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKlyLxb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelWg2Md/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZEnz5d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2lN8Me/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6pN9Re/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyWyXna/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQrG69b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8rN3je/index.m3u8"},